---
import Base from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
const crumbs=[{title:"Calculators"}];
---
<Base title="Home Maintenance Calculators" description="Practical homeowner calculators with transparent formulas, clear assumptions and print-friendly results." breadcrumbs={crumbs}>
  <section class="page-head"><div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={crumbs}/><span class="eyebrow">MEASURE TWICE</span><h1>Useful numbers, <em class="serif" style="color:var(--pine)">clearly explained.</em></h1><p class="lede">Simple calculations that make a project easier to plan. No hidden assumptions, email forms or account required.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section-small rule-top"><div class="container">
    <div class="cards">
      <a class="editorial-card" href="/tools/home-inventory/"><span class="meta">HOME RECORDS · PRIVATE WORKSHEET</span><h3>Home inventory worksheet</h3><p>List belongings by room, print a blank worksheet or export your own spreadsheet CSV.</p><span class="arrow">Build inventory ↗</span></a>
      <a class="editorial-card" href="/tools/appliance-maintenance-log/"><span class="meta">APPLIANCES · LOCAL RECORDS</span><h3>Appliance maintenance log</h3><p>Keep model-specific equipment profiles, record service history and manual-based next dates, then export a private JSON backup.</p><span class="arrow">Open appliance register ↗</span></a>
      <a class="editorial-card" href="/calculators/appliance-electricity-cost/"><span class="meta">ENERGY · RUNNING COST</span><h3>Appliance electricity cost calculator</h3><p>Estimate annual kWh and variable cost from your own wattage, operating schedule, load and electricity rate.</p><span class="arrow">Estimate electricity ↗</span></a>
      <a class="editorial-card" href="/calculators/caulk-tube-estimator/"><span class="meta">SEALANTS · QUANTITY ESTIMATOR</span><h3>Caulk tube calculator</h3><p>Estimate cartridges from bead width, depth, length and your product label volume, with a transparent allowance.</p><span class="arrow">Estimate tubes ↗</span></a>
      <a class="editorial-card" href="/calculators/paint-coverage/"><span class="meta">FINISHES · ESTIMATOR</span><h3>Interior paint coverage calculator</h3><p>Estimate wall area and gallons for a rectangular room, with coats, openings and a waste allowance you control.</p><span class="arrow">Open calculator ↗</span></a>
      <a class="editorial-card" href="/tools/seasonal-maintenance-builder/"><span class="meta">SEASONAL · CUSTOM PLANNER</span><h3>Seasonal maintenance builder</h3><p>Choose a season, broad climate conditions and home systems to print a prioritized observation plan.</p><span class="arrow">Build seasonal plan ↗</span></a>
      <a class="editorial-card" href="/tools/hvac-filter-schedule/"><span class="meta">HVAC · INSPECTION PLANNER</span><h3>HVAC filter inspection schedule</h3><p>Enter the inspection interval from your equipment manual to calculate and print your next six checks.</p><span class="arrow">Open scheduler ↗</span></a>
      <a class="editorial-card" href="/tools/custom-maintenance-checklist/"><span class="meta">PLANNING · CUSTOM CHECKLIST</span><h3>Custom home maintenance checklist</h3><p>Filter by home type and systems, save your checkmarks locally and print the checklist.</p><span class="arrow">Build checklist ↗</span></a>
      <a class="editorial-card" href="/tools/maintenance-log/"><span class="meta">PLANNING · LOCAL RECORDS</span><h3>Home maintenance log</h3><p>Record repairs and routine care privately in your browser. Import, export and print your CSV history.</p><span class="arrow">Open maintenance log ↗</span></a>
      <a class="editorial-card" href="/tools/maintenance-budget/"><span class="meta">PLANNING · SAVINGS SCENARIOS</span><h3>Annual maintenance budget calculator</h3><p>Compare your own annual and monthly savings targets, plus a reserve gap, without pretending to quote repair costs.</p><span class="arrow">Open budget calculator ↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="note" style="margin-top:3rem">Calculators provide planning estimates only. Check the actual product label, surface condition, local requirements and professional advice before purchasing or starting work.</div>
  </div></section>
</Base>
